    "Separate constrained-positive data from the exact prime-power-product consequence. factorLabel ignores its argument and returns a fixed String; retain that complete independent label helper archived rather than infer a factor-tree uniqueness, matrix index or codec law. All original import qualifications and positivity hypotheses remain."
  ],
